# Landing UI

- Tokens/fonts: `frontend/src/pages/landing/landingTokens.ts`. Keep brand-first hero; do not overpower the brand with a competing headline.
- Prefer existing Desktop/Mobile landing sections and components under `pages/landing/`.
- Avoid generic AI-default looks (purple gradients, warm cream + terracotta serif broadsheet).
- No card-heavy heroes; one job per section. Match existing motion/atmosphere patterns.
- Do not mix app dark `ledgerCoreTheme` into marketing pages unless intentionally shared.
